    (uuid "b1243ffe-f419-4ffd-96e8-f3f9343ecba8"))
  (text_box "PRINCIPLES\n1. Single fault safe: no one\n   failure puts > 10 mA or\n   sustained DC into the\n   participant (client rule:\n   imagine everything shorted).\n2. Passive first: limiter and\n   clamp need no supply, no\n   logic (purple).\n3. De-energise to safe: the\n   switches need the LED lit to\n   conduct; any lost term opens.\n4. Two independent disconnect\n   means in the loop (S1, S2).\n5. Trips are analog hardware;\n   firmware only requests,\n   never enables.\n6. Latched faults need a human\n   at the box to clear." (at 15.24 101.6 0) (size 35.56 73.66)
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type solid) (color 60 60 60 1)) (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (color 60 60 60 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "fa52d74e-27f4-45c0-a943-97e8515d387b"))
  (text_box "LEGEND\nred     stimulating path\npurple  passive limit (no supply)\namber   detector / trip\nblue    latch + enable chain\ngreen   isolation crossing\nthick   current path\ndashed  reference / status\n\nRev 1 board has: clamp, pump,\nlimiter (DNP), S1, S2, RSHR,\nread-back. Everything else on\nthis sheet is Rev 2." (at 15.24 182.88 0) (size 35.56 50.8)
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type solid) (color 60 60 60 1)) (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (color 60 60 60 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "4774a7a4-0f60-40f5-b406-cdc5d7db6bb9"))
  (text_box "TRIP SUMMARY (TARGETS, TO BE CONFIRMED ON THE BENCH)\nOC   |I_rail| > ~5.7 mA, ~22 us            latched\nOV   |V_elec| > 77-83 V                     latched\nDC   avg I_RET > 50 uA (idle) / Q > Q_max   latched\nMM   |I_RET - I_CMD| > 0.4 mA, ~47 us       latched\nRAIL +/-HV out of 90-110 V or asymmetric    not latched\nWD   no HEARTBEAT edge for > 10 ms [ASSUME]  not latched\nENGAGE / ARM / ENREQ released               not latched" (at 297.18 213.36 0) (size 83.82 33.02)
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type solid) (color 60 60 60 1)) (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (color 60 60 60 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "b73f0234-aabb-4aa5-a10e-3460db749bc0"))
